      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p01089",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“简直受不了哟！",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I just cannot stand it!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p01089",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "就这样，一年三百六十五天，每天面壁黄沙，都快熬成腌人干喽。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Like this, three hundred and sixty-five days a year, facing a wall of yellow sand every day, we are about to be dried into pickled human jerky.",
