        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p01089",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "偶尔也能让我们到那边散会儿步吧？”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Could you at least let us go over there for a walk once in a while?",
          "g": "predicate"
